@title Checkout Payment Flow
@subtitle Tidewater Grocers in-app checkout, design v2
@author Payments Engineering
@date 2026-09-22

## Payment sequence

diagram pay sequence title="In-app checkout payment"
pay: app "Mobile App" user
pay: api "Checkout API" svc
pay: fraud "Risk Engine" svc
pay: gw "Payment Gateway" ext
pay: ledger "Ledger" db
pay: app -> api : POST /checkout with cart and card token
pay: api -> fraud : score order
pay: fraud --> api : risk score
pay: note api : alt: risk score above 80
pay: api --> app : step-up verification required
pay: note api : else: risk score 80 or below
pay: api -> gw : authorize amount
pay: gw --> api : auth code
pay: api -> ledger : record pending charge
pay: ledger --> api : entry id
pay: api --> app : order confirmed

! If the risk score is above 80, Checkout API replies "step-up verification required" and never calls the Payment Gateway.

## Latency budget

data latency = Step,p95 budget (ms),Measured p95 (ms); Fraud scoring,120,88; Authorization,450,512; Ledger write,40,31; Total checkout,800,811
table latency
chart bar latency x=Step unit=ms title="p95 budget vs measured"

## Open issues

!! Authorization is over budget by 62 ms because the gateway's us-east endpoint is called from us-west-2.

- Move to the gateway's regional endpoint.
- Add a 2 second timeout with one retry.
- Alert when total checkout p95 exceeds 800 ms.
